["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Locus-Walker says: The surge of energy will tear reality apart--and will quickly wake Dimensius. Xal'atath and I will try to stabilize the Manaforge.",
